== Effects ==
* Activates the effect of {{i|Dark Arts}} for 3 seconds. Grants a temporary [[damage]] up for each enemy and projectile hit.

== Notes ==
* The damage boost effect is identical to {{c|Black Judas}}' / {{c|Tainted Judas}}' special {{i|Dark Arts}} interaction.
* See the {{i|Dark Arts}} page for more details and notes.

== Strategy ==
* Lasting thrice as long as Dark Arts, the '''Soul of Judas''' can be better used to destroy numerous projectiles shot by bosses like {{e|Mega Satan}} and {{e|Hush}}, potentially resulting in major damage buffs.

