== Trivia ==
* The quote "Right behind you" may be a reference to the [[teamfortress:Spy|Spy from ''Team Fortress 2'']], specifically in ''[https://youtu.be/OR4N5OhcY9s Meet the Spy]''.
* This Soul Stone, along with {{p|Soul of Isaac}}, {{p|Soul of Magdalene}}, and {{p|Soul of Samson}}, replicates a feature of the character it's unlocked by.

